        <p class="experience-desc">Diagnosed bugs in an EGI-M navigation unit, automated SPIRENT Simulator communications to double testing throughput, and validated system performance against DOORS requirements.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="experience-item">
        <div class="experience-header">
          <div class="experience-meta">
